.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="gran_plot linearizes the buffer region of a weak-acid titration: V_b\,10^{-pH}=K_a(V_e-V_b). Plotting the left side against V_b gives a straight line whose x-intercept is the equivalence volume and whose slope is -K_a, so the endpoint follows from data taken well before it.">

